# Internal project docs and reference material — never meant to be served. This repo
# has no build step and no dedicated "public" directory, so Vercel's static builder
# would otherwise serve the whole repo root, including these, at the deploy's own URL.
# vercel.json's rewrite only redirects "/" to src/authoring-tool.html — it doesn't stop
# every other path from resolving to whatever file sits there.
#
# Nothing in the running app fetches any of these at runtime (the example sessions are
# transcribed into authoring-tool.html's own JS, not loaded from reference/ over HTTP),
# so excluding them changes nothing about how the app behaves.
*.md
reference/
docs/
